When editing the Paris editorial explorer or kit:

- Read `AGENTS.md` in the kit root before changing `talks.ts` or hub pages.
- Quotes and metrics must trace to `data/digest.json` or `data/catalog.json`; cite timestamps for speech claims.
- Extend `VizKind` / diagram unions with exhaustive TypeScript switches (`never` in default).
- No decorative motion; one teaching animation per talk page.
- Run `npm run build` in `explorer/` after substantive UI changes.
